Sval: Remove the Firefox Bridge

The Firefox Bridge let Mozilla's extension for Chrome and Edge open links
in Firefox through native messaging, by writing a native messaging
manifest into Chrome's folders. It is off by default and Sval never
turns it on. FirefoxBridgeExtensionUtils goes with its startup idle task,
its profile migration, its prefs, its Nimbus feature and its tests.

